<title>UK: Morgan Guaranty Trust sets $250 mln four-year bond.</title>
<headline>Morgan Guaranty Trust sets $250 mln four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager J.P Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MORGAN GUARANTY TRUST</p>
<p> AMT    $250 MLN	COUPON     6.375     MATURITY    26.MAR.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.126   PAY DATE    26.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    99.726    SPREAD	+16 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 1</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC   1.40</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 5.875 PCT 2000 UST -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
